        <item>
            <title>1.0.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 13:35:04 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>DeskLayer 1.0.0</h3>
<p>First release. JavaScript plugins rendered onto the desktop wallpaper, into
floating windows, or as macOS widgets, managed from a three-pane manager.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Plugins install from a store — an Official and a Sample store are offered in the ＋ menu, and any JSON catalog URL works.</li>
  <li>Canvas, declarative SwiftUI, and webview render modes.</li>
  <li>Host APIs for plugins: system stats, shell, AppleScript, SSH, and a local HTTP hook server.</li>
  <li>English, 简体中文, and 日本語.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[
<ul><li>首个版本：JavaScript 插件渲染到桌面壁纸或浮动窗口，插件商店，自动更新。</li></ul>
            ]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="ja"><![CDATA[
<ul><li>初回リリース：JavaScript プラグインを壁紙やフローティングウィンドウに描画。プラグインストアと自動アップデート対応。</li></ul>
            ]]></description>
